  "section": "8.40",
  "rulesText": "Every creature, including every player character, has a tag in the rules that identifies the type of creature it is. Most player characters are of the Humanoid type. These are the game's creature types:\n\nThe types don't have rules themselves, but some rules in the game affect creatures of certain types in different ways.",
